WEBVTT

00:00:28.274 --> 00:00:31.360
Xo’sh,
yulduzlarga liftda borish mumkin

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.030
eng hayajonli
transport turi emas.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.784
Ammo kichikroq yuklarni yuborish
uchun qattiq tuzilmadan foydalanish

00:00:37.784 --> 00:00:40.411
orbitaga kosmonavtlar va uskunalar

00:00:40.411 --> 00:00:44.540
an’anaviy raketalardan xavfsizroq, 
osonroq va arzonroq bo’lar edi.

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:47.835
SpaceX Falcon 9 raketasida,

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:54.801
Har bir kilogramm yukni orbitaga olib 
chiqish uchun taxminan 7500 dollar turadi.

00:00:55.093 --> 00:01:00.598
Kosmik liftlar ushbu xarajatlarni 
95% ga kamaytirishi taxmin qilinmoqda ..